  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Added support for InvariantGlobalization in PDF writer.\nFixed issue with saving content as HTML to clipboard.\nFixed issue with horizontal alignment for drawings in PDF writer.\nFixed issue with underscored blank character in PDF writer.\nFixed issue with page break on tab element in PDF writer.\nFixed issue with table row spanning over multiple pages in PDF writer.\nFixed issue with font names that contain space in HTML writer.\nAdded support for rendering PictureFillBrush.\nFixed issue with rendering justify alignment.\nFixed issue with extracting page with lists from DOCX file.\nFixed issue with borders in HTML reader.\nFixed issue with invalid styles and hidden text in RTF reader.\nFixed issue with resolving headers/footers when extracting page from DOCX file.\nUpdated default compatibility mode from 14 to 15 in DOCX files.\nAdded support for CharacterFormat.AllCaps in ContentRange.ToString().",
  "repository": "",
  "requireLicenseAcceptance": true,
